API-Pages
DolphinScheduler's API tests are deployed using docker-compose. The current tests are in standalone mode and are mainly used to check some basic functions such as &quot;add, delete, change and check&quot;. For further cluster validation, such as collaboration between services or communication mechanisms between services, refer to deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml for configuration.
